},{"text":"지연, 큐잉 지연)을 고려하는 모텔을 제공할 것이다. 그 다음에는 컴퓨터 네트워킹의","words":[{"text":"지연,","x":569,"y":400,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"큐잉","x":662,"y":400,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"지연)을","x":750,"y":399,"width":115,"height":39},{"text":"고려하는","x":881,"y":398,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"모텔을","x":1035,"y":398,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"제공할","x":1156,"y":398,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":1277,"y":398,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1403,"y":403,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"다음에는","x":1455,"y":397,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1612,"y":396,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"네트워킹의","x":1731,"y":395,"width":164,"height":44}]},{"text":"주요 구조 원리, 즉 프로토콜 계충구조와 서비스 모텔을 소개한다. 우리는 또한 컴퓨터","words":[{"text":"주요","x":566,"y":462,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"구조","x":648,"y":463,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"원리,","x":733,"y":460,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"즉","x":822,"y":462,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"프로토콜","x":869,"y":461,"width":139,"height":35},{"text":"계충구조와","x":1023,"y":458,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"서비스","x":1207,"y":458,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"모텔을","x":1321,"y":458,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"소개한다.","x":1438,"y":457,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"우리는","x":1599,"y":457,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"또한","x":1716,"y":456,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":1800,"y":456,"width":93,"height":42}]},{"text":"네트워크가 많은 다양한 유형의 공격에 취약하다는 것을 배울 것이다. 그리고 이들 공","words":[{"text":"네트워크가","x":568,"y":521,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"많은","x":754,"y":521,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"다양한","x":836,"y":520,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"유형의","x":952,"y":520,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"공격에","x":1071,"y":519,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"취약하다는","x":1188,"y":519,"width":171,"height":39},{"text":"것을","x":1375,"y":518,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"배울","x":1457,"y":518,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1541,"y":517,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1667,"y